ind":"announcement","title":"Memory Palace in Next Fest","summary":"Steam's Next Fest is about to start and i am excited to see what people think of the game.If you have any suggestions or feedback please post them in the community hub.Thank you very much to everyone for taking the time to play Memory Palace :)Daniel Griffin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:25:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689091","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3859640-1839676055887464","game_id":"steam-3859640","kind":"announcement","title":"Thanks to all the players - What do YOU think?","summary":"Thank you to all the players who have tried Memory Palace so far :)What did you think? I would love to hear about:Any parts that didn't make senseWas it too easy? Too hard?feelings on graphics and audioAnd anything else you might want to share as well.And another call out to any Chinese, Japanese or French native speakers who would be willing and able to verify/edit the automated localizations then let me know :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T08:19:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887464","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3859640-1838407329265279","game_id":"steam-3859640","kind":"announcement","title":"Memory Palace Demo is live","summary":"Memory Palace Demo v0.1.0 is live :)I'm sure there are tons of bugs to find.While the English and German localisations were done by hand, the Chinese, Japanese and other languages are automated localisations from the english text. I have not included them as features on steam as I cannot verify them myself, but they can be selected through the settings. Anyone interested and able to assist with the localisations should get in contact here on the community pages.I hope you enjoy the demo and plea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T11:05:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265279","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3859640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3859640":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3859640":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4868200":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:47:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3859640","app_id":3859640,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:22Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"eb8fdc2788fc0287165dcb3cb12ba7ca95c67fe0485c2208484b25e5f08dfa09","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Rescue the princess by defeating your foes at memory card games in this retro styled pixel art adventure. Think quick for the hugely satisfying Perfect Match. Memory Palace is a great way to relax while exercising your brain.","publishers":[{"name":"Independant"}],"developers":[{"name":"Daniel Paul Griffin"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"발표 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_tba"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":" Memory Palace Demo Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/ap